-- title:
--   A publication's last committed configuration is a bootstrap configuration or a committed one
-- statement:
--   For all `P`, every cluster `W` with `Inv P W` and every sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src s pt pv)`: `P.initConfs s.lastCommittedConfiguration`, or some sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src' s' pt' pv')` has `Committed W s'.term s'.version` and `s'.lastAcceptedConfiguration = s.lastCommittedConfiguration`.
